import{_ as n,o as t,c as i,a2 as r}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 793 | Transcended Ones and Ethics | The Transcended One's Limited-Interference Boundary","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 793 | Transcended Ones and Ethics | The Transcended One's Limited-Interference Boundary","no":793,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Ethics","Limited Interference","Boundary","Disaster Response"],"related":["83-Observe-First-Then-Limit-Interfere Principle","86-Isolated-Space Low-Pollution Procedure","792-Non-Interference Principle"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0793_模块4-伦理-有限干涉边界.md","filePath":"en/0793_模块4-伦理-有限干涉边界.md"}`),a={name:"en/0793_模块4-伦理-有限干涉边界.md"};function o(s,e,l,d,c,h){return t(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[r('<h1 id="entry-793-transcended-ones-and-ethics-the-transcended-one-s-limited-interference-boundary" tabindex="-1">Entry 793 | Transcended Ones and Ethics | The Transcended One&#39;s Limited-Interference Boundary <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-793-transcended-ones-and-ethics-the-transcended-one-s-limited-interference-boundary" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 793 | Transcended Ones and Ethics | The Transcended One&#39;s Limited-Interference Boundary&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 83, 86, 792</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-non-interference-does-not-mean-never-striking" tabindex="-1">Introduction: non-interference does not mean never striking <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-non-interference-does-not-mean-never-striking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: non-interference does not mean never striking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Entry 792 covered the non-interference principle, but a real-world question cannot be avoided: <strong>if Myriad Ranks are being slaughtered by predators, if cross-plane pollution is devouring a galaxy, if civilization-level disaster has already occurred, does the transcended one still not interfere?</strong> Of course not. The limited-interference boundary this entry discusses answers: under the non-interference principle&#39;s broad framework, in what circumstances may the transcended one strike? To what extent? This entry draws this boundary clearly.</p><p>Six top-level axioms all line up: the anti-predation axiom requires interference directly target predation; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires interference have Myriad-Rank consent; the collective ascension axiom requires interference serve uplift; the causal self-discipline axiom requires interference be strictly bounded; the law-first axiom requires boundaries be clear at the law layer, not expandable.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-limited-interference-s-three-statutory-conditions" tabindex="-1">I. Limited Interference&#39;s Three Statutory Conditions <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-limited-interference-s-three-statutory-conditions" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Limited Interference&#39;s Three Statutory Conditions&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one may strike and interfere only when three statutory conditions are simultaneously met:</p><ol><li><strong>Disaster condition</strong>: a plane-level or cross-plane disaster is occurring — predatory-faction slaughter, cross-plane pollution, law-network fracture, civilization-level life threat;</li><li><strong>Request condition</strong>: the affected Myriad-Rank clan actively requests the transcended one&#39;s intervention, or Alaya Network monitors a Myriad-Rank-wide consensus requesting intervention;</li><li><strong>Proportionality condition</strong>: the action the transcended one takes is the minimal action necessary to stop the disaster, not expanded.</li></ol><p>Three conditions, no substitute. Any one unmet, the transcended one continues non-interference.</p><h2 id="ii-interference-s-four-boundaries" tabindex="-1">II. Interference&#39;s Four Boundaries <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-interference-s-four-boundaries" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Interference&#39;s Four Boundaries&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Even when three conditions are met, interference has four hard boundaries:</p><ul><li><strong>Minimal boundary</strong>: only do what is necessary to stop the disaster; no &quot;conveniently&quot; doing other things. Stop the slaughter, do not by the way transform the rescued clan;</li><li><strong>Short-term boundary</strong>: interference only lasts until the disaster ends. The disaster stops, the transcended one immediately withdraws, does not stay to &quot;guide&quot;;</li><li><strong>Knowledge boundary</strong>: knowledge gained during interference is backflowed to Myriad Ranks through the Selfless Dao, but the order established during interference is not imposed on Myriad Ranks;</li><li><strong>Isolation boundary</strong>: interference is conducted as much as possible in isolated space (Document 64) or low-pollution zones, reducing disturbance to the original plane&#39;s causality.</li></ul><p>Four boundaries together; interference is &quot;hemostasis,&quot; not &quot;surgery.&quot; After hemostasis, the doctor leaves; the patient recovers on his own.</p><h2 id="iii-post-interference-withdrawal-mechanism" tabindex="-1">III. Post-Interference Withdrawal Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-post-interference-withdrawal-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Post-Interference Withdrawal Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The link where interference most easily goes wrong is <strong>withdrawal</strong>. Many interferers after striking do not leave, stay to &quot;guide,&quot; finally becoming occupation. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s withdrawal mechanism has three steps:</p><ol><li><strong>Withdrawal declaration</strong>: after the disaster ends, the transcended one publicly declares interference ended, withdrawing all non-essential personnel and computable power;</li><li><strong>Handover list</strong>: the temporary order, temporary facilities, and temporary communications established during interference are completely handed over to Myriad Ranks&#39; own management;</li><li><strong>Withdrawal audit</strong>: the Anchor Supervisory Committee audits the whole interference process, confirming whether it truly &quot;fought and left,&quot; not &quot;lingered.&quot;</li></ol><p>Three-step withdrawal ensures interference is &quot;helped and left,&quot; not &quot;helped and occupied.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-relationship-with-entry-789-s-immunity-boundary" tabindex="-1">IV. Relationship with Entry 789&#39;s Immunity Boundary <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-relationship-with-entry-789-s-immunity-boundary" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Relationship with Entry 789&#39;s Immunity Boundary&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Entry 789 covered &quot;emergency-avoidance immunity&quot;; this entry covers &quot;limited interference.&quot; Their relationship:</p><ul><li><strong>Emergency-avoidance immunity</strong> is the law layer — the transcended one in emergencies may bypass normal legal procedure;</li><li><strong>Limited-interference boundary</strong> is the ethics layer — even when immunity takes effect, interference itself has boundaries.</li></ul><p>Immunity is &quot;may act first&quot;; boundary is &quot;how far to act.&quot; Both stack: the transcended one may strike in emergencies, but the strike must be within limited boundaries. Immunity grants the right to strike; the boundary limits the strike&#39;s scope.</p><p>After interference ends there is still an after-the-fact review. Every time the transcended one exercises the limited-interference right, he must within one cycle after interference ends submit a complete report to the Anchor Supervisory Committee: whether the interference trigger condition was truly met, whether interference means were minimized, whether local causality was disturbed after interference, whether withdrawal was clean. The Supervisory Committee cross-checks with Alaya Network data, confirming the report matches actual behavior. If &quot;in the name of interference but actually predation&quot; or &quot;excessive interference causing local civilizational autonomy damage&quot; is found, not only is immunity withdrawn, but the transcended one&#39;s civilizational weight is retroactively adjusted. After-the-fact review locks interference power in a cage — you may strike in emergencies, but every motion of your strike will be reckoned after the fact.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: limited interference puts computable power on disasters truly needing it, avoiding computable power being wasted on &quot;guiding Myriad Ranks&quot;</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: interference directly targets predatory factions, while preventing interference itself from becoming new predation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo arranges everything for Myriad Ranks; Heng Yuan Zhou requires the transcended one only strike during disasters, then leave</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: interference applies equally to all Myriad-Rank clans; no &quot;this clan deserves rescue, that clan deserves it&quot;</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: interference&#39;s entire cases and boundary-execution records are opened network-wide through the Selfless Dao. When the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm transcended one exercises limited-interference right, his civilizational weight must cover the relevant clans</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Non-interference does not mean never striking. Myriad Ranks being slaughtered, galaxies being polluted, laws fracturing — in these times the transcended one must strike. But striking has boundaries: minimal, short-term, only backflowing knowledge, isolated operation, fight and leave. Interference is hemostasis, not occupation. After hemostasis, how the wound heals is Myriad Ranks&#39; own business.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/83-先观测后有限干涉准则.html">Entry 83 · Observe-First-Then-Limit-Interfere Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/86-隔离空间低污染流程.html">Entry 86 · Isolated-Space Low-Pollution Procedure</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/792_模块4-伦理-不干涉原则.html">Entry 792 · Non-Interference Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/789-法律约束与豁免边界.html">Entry 789 · Legal Constraints and Immunity Boundaries</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const f=n(a,[["render",o]]);export{m as __pageData,f as default};
